[00:01.00]作曲 : 8hoop, Nomasgood(BADX)
[00:26.05]We climb with borrowed breath
[00:29.18]Hands numb from holding on
[00:32.49]Every step is measured
[00:35.87]Every name gets worn
[00:39.49]The ground is never even
[00:42.70]It tilts the higher we go
[00:46.26]You learn which lines to follow
[00:50.06]And which ones not to know
[00:53.49]They say the view is worth it
[00:57.09]When you finally arrive
[01:00.92]But nobody tells you
[01:03.91]What it costs to stay alive
[01:08.47]We don’t look back
[01:09.82]We don’t slow down
[01:11.45]Every crown is taken
[01:12.95]From someone on the ground
[01:14.74]If I let you stand
[01:16.52]I lose my place
[01:18.05]So we smile and keep on climbing
[01:21.75]In this summit game
[01:22.08]We don’t look back
[01:23.89]We don’t slow down
